## Graph Legend

- Node colors:
  - yellow = PLC / controller / primary OT endpoint
  - purple = engineering / HMI / SCADA / scanner-like endpoint
  - light blue = infrastructure service participant such as DNS / NTP
  - red = public / external endpoint
  - pale blue = other internal endpoint
- Edge colors:
  - brown = industrial protocol
  - blue = DNS
  - teal = NTP
  - purple = VPN / remote access
  - green = management / web / remote administration
  - gray = ICMP
  - dark gray = other / unknown
- Cluster boxes group endpoints by subnet or by external/public scope.


